{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54573","headline":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 三 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占雾第五（京本列第八○十首） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相对敌，有雾敌（京本作「客」）边来。\n似雨纷纷来（京本作「须」）势急，如烟入眼目（京本作「眼」）难开。\n马步一齐（京本作「时」）来。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54573.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54573","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}